<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 401)</h2>
<p><b>Manual fixes: clean keycaps, and figures where they were missing.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Shortcut keycaps no longer show raw <code>**</code> markers — the Getting Started tables read as keys, not markdown.</li>
<li>The interface close-ups now run through <b>Getting Started</b> too: the viewer, transport bar, tool palette, notes sidebar, version wipe, filmstrip and cheat sheet, one per section.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
